### Create a new school
POST http://localhost:8080/api/schools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Green Valley School",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "phoneNumber": "1234567890"
}

### Get all schools
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schools

### Get a school by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/schools/1

### Update a school
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/schools/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Green Valley School Updated",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "phoneNumber": "0987654321"
}

### Delete a school
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/schools/1